The Stranger's polish round: for Eric, on the orphan branch stills/stranger-polish (commit 45409b12).

- stranger-ult-phone.gif: the whole ult on a phone, real speed, from its banner to the storm's first turn (16 s).
- stranger-ult-desktop.gif: the same on a computer.
- stranger-entrance-phone.gif: his entrance on tower floor 10 (out of the elevator, his two lines, his blades), about 10 s.
- stranger-entrance-desktop.png: the entrance on a computer, his blades out.
- stranger-storm-turn-phone.png: a storm turn, everything but the board shaded, the rift at 50%.
- stranger-unlocked-notice-phone.png, -desktop.png: "The Stranger is now available in Boss Battle".

What changed in the ult: nothing of the storm before his banner (it showed for about 450 ms); the banner whole before his leap (it
covered his landing and his swords coming out); his hop from his own figure's box, growing as he flies, and back (no size jump); the
ring gathers from nothing round the board as the cracks grow (wisps, a thin line running round, then the full band by his grip); the
page shaded 50% from the first sword through the three turns, the board not; the rift at 50%; no blink at each turn's start.

For Eric to pick or change: his second line ("I crossed worlds for a real fight. Be one."); his speech boxes stay lit in the shade;
the notice has one button (OK).
